---
---

<section class="what-we-do py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 bg-ai-surface relative overflow-hidden border-b border-ai-border">
  <div class="what-we-do__backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <p class="what-we-do__kicker">Society Runtime</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.055em] mb-4 text-ai-fg">
        Learn, build, critique, repeat.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ai-fg-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Surrey Artificial Intelligence Society is a student-led community for learning, building, discussing, and applying artificial intelligence. We welcome students from every discipline and experience level.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <div class="what-we-do__card bg-ai-bg border border-ai-border p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ai-cyan/10 text-ai-cyan mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-ai-fg">Learn</h3>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          Beginner-friendly workshops on machine learning, generative AI, computer vision, and more. No prerequisites &mdash; just curiosity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="what-we-do__card bg-ai-bg border border-ai-border p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ai-purple/10 text-ai-purple mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-ai-fg">Build</h3>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          Hands-on build nights, collaborative projects, and hackathons where you turn ideas into working prototypes alongside other students.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="what-we-do__card bg-ai-bg border border-ai-border p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ai-cyan/10 text-ai-cyan mb-4" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2 text-ai-fg">Connect</h3>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          Join a welcoming community of AI-curious students, attend discussions on ethics and policy, and shape how AI is understood at Surrey.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-we-do__backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 14% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ai-cyan) 15%, transparent), transparent 24rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 86% 38%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ai-purple) 11%, transparent), transparent 27rem);
  }

  .what-we-do__kicker {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    color: var(--ai-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .what-we-do__card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ai-surface) 92%, transparent), color-mix(in srgb, var(--ai-bg) 90%, transparent));
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 color-mix(in srgb, #ffffff 44%, transparent);
  }

  .what-we-do__card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0;
    height: 0.18rem;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ai-cyan), var(--ai-purple));
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
